# Line-ending policy.
#
# Hash-pinned correction-table CSVs are validated by raw-byte sha256
# (correction_validation.py), so CRLF conversion on Windows checkouts breaks
# the manifest gate (issue #107). Force LF checkouts for all CSVs.
*.csv text eol=lf
# The complexity gate compares canonical cap bytes with Git history on Windows.
dev-docs/complexity_caps.json text eol=lf
